config PLE_GOODIX
	bool "Nokia PLE exact-stock Goodix TEE navigation interface"
	depends on OF && GPIOLIB && REGULATOR && FB
	help
	  PLE619F platform GPIO/power/IRQ interface. The stock TEE decoder
	  receives SIGIO and returns validated customer1 key events via G ioctls.
	  This driver does not access biometric templates or implement SPI/TEE.
